                ;; after-revoke, and after-prepare-pause (where prepare matched updated subscription so 1 match_decision each is written, while commit-time
                ;; batch getSubscriptionStates + isContributionEffective rejected disabled principal / post-prepare pause so 0 deliveries and 0 contributions are written):
